[12.644602, "o", "Virtual Wire Simulator - Capstone Demo\r\n=======================================\r\n\r\n=== Clean Wire (no impairments) ===\r\nInput:  de ad be ef ca fe \r\nOutput: de ad be ef ca fe \r\nResult: delivered\r\nMatch:  YES\r\n\r\n=== Noisy Wire (BER = 0.01) ===\r\nInput:  ff ff ff ff ff ff ff ff \r\nOutput: 7f ff ff ff ff ff ff ff \r\nStats:  TX: 1  RX: 1  Dropped: 0  Bit errors: 1  Reordered: 0  Loss rate: 0.0000\r\n\r\n=== Lossy Wire (drop_prob = 0.3) ===\r\n  Frame  1: DROPPED\r\n  Frame  2: DROPPED\r\n  Frame  3: delivered\r\n"]
[12.644692, "o", "  Frame  4: delivered\r\n  Frame  5: delivered\r\n  Frame  6: delivered\r\n  Frame  7: DROPPED\r\n  Frame  8: DROPPED\r\n  Frame  9: delivered\r\n  Frame 10: DROPPED\r\n  Frame 11: delivered\r\n  Frame 12: DROPPED\r\n  Frame 13: delivered\r\n  Frame 14: delivered\r\n  Frame 15: delivered\r\n  Frame 16: delivered\r\n  Frame 17: delivered\r\n  Frame 18: delivered\r\n  Frame 19: delivered\r\n  Frame 20: delivered\r\nDelivered: 14/20, Dropped: 6/20\r\nLoss rate: 0.30\r\n\r\n=== Delay + Jitter (1000us +/- 200us) ===\r\n"]
[12.644741, "o", "  Frame  1 delay: 401 us\r\n  Frame  2 delay: 550 us\r\n  Frame  3 delay: 915 us\r\n  Frame  4 delay: 902 us\r\n  Frame  5 delay: 1074 us\r\n  Frame  6 delay: 1107 us\r\n  Frame  7 delay: 922 us\r\n  Frame  8 delay: 964 us\r\n  Frame  9 delay: 800 us\r\n  Frame 10 delay: 1201 us\r\n\r\n=== Full Channel (BER=0.001, drop=0.05, delay=500us, jitter=50us) ===\r\n"]
[12.644752, "o", "After 100 frames:\r\n  TX: 100  RX: 96  Dropped: 4  Bit errors: 30  Reordered: 0  Loss rate: 0.0400\r\n\r\n"]
